    "turn_text": "Well, obviously serving as a member of Congress advances the public service interest and then I think a lot of my work since I left Congress about five years now, both in the private sector and as well as the former members association members of Congress where we try to really educate citizens and colleges and high schools and universities, as well as a lot of corporations on how Congress works, why it's important to be a knowledgeable citizen so that you can help contribute to this country and make it better.",
