    "turn_text": "you actually flipped a Democratic district when that they can see a rose in 1988. It had been a democratic district, of course, your Republican. What did that indicate that the electorate had been shifting in their opinions or to what might you attribute your initial success beating a Democrat in a district that previously had been occupied by a Democrat?",
