    "turn_idx": 14,
    "turn_text": "So you mentioned you alluded to a topic, the topic of gerrymandering. uh... you mentioned that the former of speaker of the florida house of delegates in kalahashi had created a district that he thought was a shoe in district for him or at least for the democrats uh... and of course you were able to overcome that uh... gerrymandering to beat him do",
